  "instructions": [
    "Heat the ghee in a tagine pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the cumin seeds and let them sizzle for a few seconds.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the grated ginger and minced garlic and cook for another minute.",
    "Add the diced Cox apples and cook until they start to soften.",
    "Add the spinach puree, coriander powder, salt, and pepper, and stir well.",
    "Add the paneer cubes and stir gently to combine.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 15 minutes.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh cilantro or scallions."
